# SinHalfPiReflection: real complementary-angle formula.
# Gate: target/release/litex -strict -f examples/proof_nodes/equal/by_builtin_rule/sin_half_pi_reflection.lit
# Before: failed in search_proof.
# forall x R:
#     sin(pi/2-x)=cos(x)
forall x R:
    sin(pi/2-x)=cos(x)
forall x R:
    cos(x)=sin((-x)+0.5*pi)
forall x R:
    sin(pi/2-(x+1))=cos(x+1)
# Boundary: negative cosine, pi/3 in place of pi/2 and complex inputs reject.
